  "Info": {
    "Name": "Relay Dark",
    "Version": 1,
    "Author": "Duong Dieu Phap",
    "Description": "Relay Dark puts lime and chalk-white controls on deep graphite surfaces. Its icons use rounded bars and clear cutouts, with square magnifiers and film-strip gallery symbols. The \"ig\" logo is a lime tile with a dark monogram, and the toolbar and menus are a little lighter than the image background."
  },
